 Jan underscore sales, Feb"}, {"start_seconds": 265.72, "end_seconds": 270.12, "text": "underscore sales, and March underscore"}, {"start_seconds": 267.36, "end_seconds": 271.52, "text": "sales. We would like to keep only Jan"}, {"start_seconds": 270.12, "end_seconds": 273.4, "text": "underscore sales and Feb underscore"}, {"start_seconds": 271.52, "end_seconds": 276.6, "text": "sales values."}, {"start_seconds": 273.4, "end_seconds": 279.24, "text": "And that is where"}, {"start_seconds": 276.6, "end_seconds": 280.88, "text": "value underscore vars parameter will"}, {"start_seconds": 279.24, "end_seconds": 283.16, "text": "come in handy."}, {"start_seconds": 280.88, "end_seconds": 285.04, "text": "Pass the list of the columns"}, {"start_seconds": 283.16, "end_seconds": 287.6, "text": "which you would like to keep, Jan"}, {"start_seconds": 285.04, "end_seconds": 290.84, "text": "underscore sales and"}, {"start_seconds": 287.6, "end_seconds": 290.84, "text": "Feb underscore sales."}, {"start_seconds": 291.76, "end_seconds": 296.92, "text": "And let's run the code."}, {"start_seconds": 293.96, "end_seconds": 296.92, "text": "Let's see the output."}, {"start_seconds": 297.88, "end_seconds": 304.16, "text": "And you can see this time we have only"}, {"start_seconds": 301.08, "end_seconds": 306.16, "text": "six records and it is not uh"}, {"start_seconds": 304.16, "end_seconds": 308.2, "text": "transforming March underscore sales"}, {"start_seconds": 306.16, "end_seconds": 311.12, "text": "value. It had disregarded that"}, {"start_seconds": 308.2, "end_seconds": 313.0, "text": "particular column from our output. And"}, {"start_seconds": 311.12, "end_seconds": 315.64, "text": "that's how you reshape your data in"}, {"start_seconds": 313.0, "end_seconds": 318.76, "text": "seconds using pandas melt method."}, {"start_seconds": 315.64, "end_seconds": 321.32, "text": "Remember, melt turns column into rows"}, {"start_seconds": 318.76, "end_seconds": 323.96, "text": "while pivot does the opposite. This"}, {"start_seconds": 321.32, "end_seconds": 325.8, "text": "simple trick will save you tons of time"}, {"start_seconds": 323.96, "end_seconds": 328.12, "text": "when cleaning or preparing your data for"}, {"start_seconds": 325.8, "end_seconds": 329.88, "text": "analysis or visualization. And that's it"}, {"start_seconds": 328.12, "end_seconds": 333.0, "text": "for today. Thanks for watching and I'll"}, {"start_seconds": 329.88, "end_seconds": 333.0, "text": "catch you in the next session."}]}